      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BONITO (7) goes very well this course and distance starting 12 times for five wins and four minors. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (24.22) in a Grade 4/5 over 407m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. BANDIT CHLOE (2) was well off top last time, finishing 4th (20.37) in a Mix 5 at Capalaba. Great record here at the trip having never missed the frame including two wins. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Likely to be thereabouts. SHE'S FULL ON (1) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (24.55) last time in a Grade 3/4 at this track. Has the ability to give this a shake. BELLA MATILDA (6) placed last time out so worth considering.",
